          "name": "Source Text",
          "type": "CUTF8StringView&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "STextRange",
      "docs": "Converts an index-based range of Unicode code points (start, end) to a row/column-based range (start row/column, end row/column).\n@param IndexRange    The range of Unicode code points to convert.\n@param SourceText    The full source text that corresponds to the range about to be converted.\n@return              A row-column range that is equivalent to the index-based range."
